 da: angular width (degrees), \n#      v: median velocity (km/s)\n#     dv: variation (1 sigma) of velocity over the width of the CME\n#   minv: lowest velocity detected within the CME\n#   maxv: highest velocity detected within the CME\n#  halo?: II if da>90, III if da>180, IV if da>270, indicating potential halo/partial halo CME\n# \n  </PRE>\n <td valign='top'>\n  <PRE>\n# CME |          t0    | dt0| pa | da |  v  |  dv | minv| maxv| halo?\n  <a href=\"CME0028/CME.html\" target=\"_blank\" >0028</a>|2026/09/11 14:00| 02 | 309| 012| 0313| 0044| 0266| 0392|    \n  <a href=\"CME0027/CME.html\" target=\"_blank\" >0027</a>|2026/09/10 20:48| 01 | 044| 006| 0768| 0252| 0385| 0976|    \n  <a href=\"CME0026/CME.html\" target=\"_blank\" >0026</a>|2026/09/10 20:24| 02 | 006| 014| 0329| 0118| 0145| 0473|    \n  <a href=\"CME0025/CME.html\" target=\"_blank\" >0025</a>|2026/09/10 20:12| 02 | 039| 016| 0233| 0080| 0147| 0372|    \n  <a href=\"CME0024/CME.html\" target=\"_blank\" >0024</a>|2026/09/10 20:00| 03 | 316| 122| 0419| 0106| 0175| 0624|  II\n  <a href=\"CME0023/CME.html\" target=\"_blank\" >0023</a>|2026/09/10 16:12| 04 | 237| 044| 018"
